credit card delinquencies,

00:05:58.416 --> 00:05:59.249
excuse me, are skyrocketing.

00:05:59.249 --> 00:06:01.320
Now, that video came out about a month ago

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.360
we're gonna link to it on the page

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.190
