00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:08.100
But we are seeing increased
defaults by businesses.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:11.040
We're seeing increased
delinquency rates by individuals.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.440
Basically people are
taking on a bunch of debt

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.210
and a bunch of credit
that they can't afford

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.530
and they're starting to go delinquent.

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:18.090
Same thing is happening with businesses.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:20.340
We're not reaching levels
