00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:21.990
It's still a small number of people

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.210
but the increase has been very rapid.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.160
One of the fastest
increase rates in history.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.960
We break all that down in the video

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.520
