00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.600
in the JOLTS survey and the
number of unemployed people.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.790
And as you can see, the
number of job openings

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.170
historically had never risen

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:00.060
above the number of unemployed people.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:02.670
We are seeing that now where it's not only

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:03.870
are there more job openings

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.370
than there are unemployed people,

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:07.590
there's about two to one,
there's about two openings

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:09.780
for every unemployed person,
that hasn't moved yet.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.274
You see there at the edge of your screen,

00:07:11.274 --> 00:07:14.190
that number not really going
higher, not really going lower.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.780
They're staying about stagnant.

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.067
Fed chair, Jerome Powell has
highlighted this and said,

00:07:18.067 --> 00:07:19.867
"Hey, this is a problem for the economy.

00:07:19.867 --> 00:07:21.937
"It's giving workers a
little too much leverage,

00:07:21.937 --> 00:07:25.267
"giving them more leverage
to negotiate higher raises,

00:07:25.267 --> 00:07:27.187
"higher pay increases
when they start a new job.

00:07:27.187 --> 00:07:29.310
"And that's gonna keep inflation high."

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:31.380
The Fed needs to bring
inflation back down.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.240
Basically the problem
is consumers have money

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:34.950
and when they have money,
they go out and spend.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.200
And so even when companies
are raising prices,

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.960
increasing prices over and
over, consumers keep paying

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.430
and that's what pushes inflation higher.

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:43.890
So Fed has been watching
this, you should watch it.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.240
JOLTS report out on Tuesday.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:47.760
This charge is kind of
illustrating the overall theme

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:51.360
